      "safetyNotes": "Mark the 2 m² square plot on the school field in daylight, away from the road, with learners staying behind the marked lines. Use calculators carefully and keep them away from the edges of desks. If no field is available, mark the scale model with chalk or string on the classroom floor. Do not run while measuring."
